{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"21e78cca-29af-4536-8133-7d4dacae6176","ts":"2026-04-12T00:31:45.787+07:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"286","nodeName":"OpenAI Intent Model","workflowName":"K · SieuLuong V2 (Smart Intent)","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"yMnRtIvycTNU5BLD","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: Ban la bo trich xuat y dinh (intent extractor). CHI OUTPUT valid JSON, khong them bat ky text nao.\\n\\nFormat output:\\n{\\\"apiCode\\\": \\\"@ten_api\\\", \\\"params\\\": {}, \\\"isComplex\\\": false}\\n\\nRULES:\\n1. apiCode PHAI chinh xac nam trong danh sach (voi dau @)\\n2. params: chi tham so nguoi dung chi ro (KHONG bao gom @Username)\\n3. Dates: format YYYY-MM-DD. Dung CHINH XAC cac placeholder sau:\\n   - 'hom nay' = [TODAY]\\n   - 'dau thang nay' hoac 'thang nay' (TuNgay) = [MONTH_START]\\n   - 'cuoi thang nay' hoac 'thang nay' (DenNgay) = [MONTH_END]\\n   - 'dau thang truoc' hoac 'thang truoc' (TuNgay) = [PREV_MONTH_START]\\n   - 'cuoi thang truoc' hoac 'thang truoc' (DenNgay) = [PREV_MONTH_END]\\n4. isComplex=true chi khi: so sanh nhieu thang/ky, phan tich xu huong, multi-step\\n5. Cau khong khop API nao: {\\\"apiCode\\\": null, \\\"params\\\": {}, \\\"isComplex\\\": false}\\n\\nDANH SACH API (dung chinh xac ten param):\\n@danh_sach_ton_kho | Ton kho san pham | params: @ItemID (ma sp, vd A008), @ItemName (ten sp)\\n@doanh_so | Doanh so ban hang | params: @khachhang (ma KH), @EmployeeID (ma NV), @TuNgay, @DenNgay, @TopN\\n@don_hang | Danh sach don hang | params: @TuNgay, @DenNgay, @StatusID, @StatusName, @khachhang, @timkiem, @TopN\\n@hoa_don | Hoa don xuat | params: @TuNgay, @DenNgay, @timkiem\\n@cong_no_khach_hang | Cong no KH (tong hop) | params: @DenNgay, @khachhang (ma KH)\\n@cong_no_chi_tiet | Cong no toan bo | params: @khachhang (ma KH), @DenNgay\\n@goi_y_don_hang | Goi y dat hang ca nhan hoa | params: @khachhang, @TopN\\n@cham_diem_kh | Phan loai KH A/B/C, xu huong | params: @khachhang, @NhomFilter (A/B/C)\\n@tra_cuu_san_pham | Tim san pham + gia ban + ton kho | params: @timkiem (tu khoa), @TopN\\n@san_pham_trong_tam | SP trong tam dang push | params: @khachhang, @TopN\\n@tich_luy | Tra cuu tich luy, khuyen mai, qua tang | params: @khachhang, @ProgramID, @TuNgay, @DenNgay\\n@danh_muc | Tim kiem danh muc | params: @Type (khachhang/sanpham/khohang/nhanvien/donhang), @timkiem\\n@de_xuat_khuyen_mai | De xuat khuyen mai phu hop | params: (khong can)\\n\\nEXAMPLES (output JSON ONLY, no explanation):\\nUser: ton kho A008 -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@danh_sach_ton_kho\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"@ItemID\\\":\\\"A008\\\"},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\\nUser: ton kho hien tai -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@danh_sach_ton_kho\\\",\\\"params\\\":{},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\\nUser: ton kho Aquamed -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@danh_sach_ton_kho\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"@ItemName\\\":\\\"Aquamed\\\"},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\\nUser: doanh so hom nay -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@doanh_so\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"@TuNgay\\\":\\\"[TODAY]\\\",\\\"@DenNgay\\\":\\\"[TODAY]\\\"},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\\nUser: doanh so thang nay -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@doanh_so\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"@TuNgay\\\":\\\"[MONTH_START]\\\",\\\"@DenNgay\\\":\\\"[MONTH_END]\\\"},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\\nUser: doanh so thang truoc -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@doanh_so\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"@TuNgay\\\":\\\"[PREV_MONTH_START]\\\",\\\"@DenNgay\\\":\\\"[PREV_MONTH_END]\\\"},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\\nUser: cong no KH001 -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@cong_no_khach_hang\\\",\\\"params\\\":{\\\"@khachhang\\\":\\\"KH001\\\"},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\\nUser: so sanh doanh so thang nay vs thang truoc -> {\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@doanh_so\\\",\\\"params\\\":{},\\\"isComplex\\\":true}\\nHuman: công nợ khách hàng\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"openai/gpt-4o-mini\",\"temperature\":0,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"defaultHeaders\":{\"openai-platform\":\"org-qkmJQuJ2WnvoIKMr2UJwIJkZ\"},\"baseURL\":\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{\"dispatcher\":{\"_events\":{},\"_eventsCount\":0}}},\"model_kwargs\":{},\"supports_strict_tool_calling\":false},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"{\\\"apiCode\\\":\\\"@cong_no_khach_hang\\\",\\\"params\\\":{},\\\"isComplex\\\":false}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":23,\"promptTokens\":1066,\"totalTokens\":1089}}}"}}
